wh + but —\nn a sty approach\nn a cl v gtal int v achieving a\ngtal int in t future. This is\nmy posn in Wygant\nBut a weak v indef to t\ncity of Richmond\na def btw legis rems + judic rems\nlegis v n to deter who is dg\n+ wrong. Wn ty do, t rem\nhs given bens to tse who hv\nsuffered. So in t Fullilove case\nThis case is dif.\nmust assume so Kors hv n b\nG v discrim.\n2 is n narrowly tailored\nN limited to cits v Richmond\nThe minority bus prime Kor cd\nsub K to set-a firms\nn one testi to he ws a victim\nN t right wa to go about it\n\nO&#x27;Connor, J. +\nNo fdgs ca minority Kors\nNo ev v city discrim\npernicious race-based\npractices\n\nScalia, J. +\ncity is dg what it did b4\nthe &quot;ins&quot; lining own pockets\nI am n concerned ca racists\nns agree wi HAB.\nlet US do this U.S., n cities\nBut agree wi 2 yrds BRW mentions\nlegis a cts n dif\n\nKennedy, J. +\nordin unconstl in its racial\npreferences —\nleave open any ? v city&#x27;s own past\ndiscrim — no ev v th here\ndefin v minority is too broad\n@ Hispanic strong Kors of SW\nwd impose unfair 2c on t innocent</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1988 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>Mark H. Oring v. State Bar of California</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/9db40bd7-909d-4a18-9461-533ab07aa044.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3456/5184\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>The Chief Justice Advertising\nviolation but did he\nstipulate himself out of\ncourt\nPresumption of\nmisleading permissible\nfor state to adopt\n\nWhite, J.